# The cooling loop reference from plan/00-foundation/01-vision-and-scope.md.
#
# `dn` is stated on the return line because nothing chooses a size yet; without it the pipe cannot be built, and a
# dropped pipe cuts the primary in two. P3.5's catalogue turns a designation into a bore -- it does not
# pick the designation, which is sizing. Remove it when P3.7 lands: 01's block is the canonical form
# and does not carry it.

fluidscript 1
circuit coolingLoop
fluid water
style blue 2px fillet --
show temperature

HE1 heat_exchanger power=30 in.t=20 out.t=50
3WV three_way_valve
PU1 pump

connections
N1 - N2                      # primary supply into the mixing node
N2 - PU1                     # the secondary pump drives the loop
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - 3WV
3WV.b - N2                   # recirculation branch — closes the secondary loop
3WV.a - N3 length=25 dn=25                    # primary return

N1 inlet t=6 p=300          # primary-side boundary: fluid enters here (D-64)
N3 outlet p=280              # and leaves here
